From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: krane <chris@krane.dev>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 17:26:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(bar): choose the left sidebar button icon, color and
 icon folder

The left sidebar button icon could only be changed by editing config.json, it had no color setting, and with AI, translator and anime off the button hid itself, which left the Agents tab unreachable.

Port of pctrade/end4-pC 52814a6 onto bar.topLeftIcon: new bar.topLeftIconColor and bar.topLeftIconsPath, IconPickerGrid and a Left sidebar button section in Settings, Bar. The fork keeps these under custom.* and has a colorize switch; neither is adopted. The picker stores the bare name, the button appends -symbolic for built-in icons only, an icon from the custom folder keeps its file name. The button also shows when sidebar.agents.enable is on.

Drop when the pinned ii has an icon picker for the left sidebar button.
